{
  "id": "VC-FLD-01..06",
  "title": "Compressible-flow relations, gamma 1.4 (NACA Report 1135 tables)",
  "source": "Ames Research Staff. Equations, tables, and charts for compressible flow. NACA Report 1135, 1953 (NTRS 19930091059; NASA-hosted PDF www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/equations-tables-charts-compressibleflow-report-1135.pdf). Values are printed to 4 significant figures in the report tables; the rows below were confirmed against independent reproductions of those tables (search extracts) and recomputed from the report's closed-form equations. Rows graded A are confirmed by two independent sources: printed tables (Cengel & Cimbala appendix tables A-13..A-16, IIT Delhi gas tables, reproductions of NACA 1135) and/or the independent open-source implementation pygasflow 1.4.1 (PyPI), whose outputs (shockwave_solver, fanno_solver, rayleigh_solver) agree with every value below to all printed digits.",
